    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ eac swilce cynges hordera oððe ure gerefena hwylc ðara ðeofa gewita wære ðe staledon, beo he be ðam ilcan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in like manner also, any of the royal treasurers or [any] of our reeves who have been accessories to thieves, who have been guilty of stealing, shall suffer the same [penalty].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ eac swylc cynges hordere oððe ure gerefena, hwylc ðara ðeofa gewita wære ðe staledon, beo be ðam ilcan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
